    <!-- END Sub Nav -->    
        <!-- Main -->
    <div class="top-text">
        <div class="wrap">
            <div class="inner">
                <p>Rent the Grand Theater: a Historic venue with world-class production capabilities</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- Main Text -->  
    <!-- Main -->
<div id="main">

	<div class="p2-article">
		        <section class="p2 white">
            <div class="wrap text-center">
                                    <a class="button color-4 button-large" href="https://airtable.com/appHZcmX68z1AwtEE/pagBWd7oBGvByR5Vq/form">Venue Rental Form</a>
                            </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 image-gallery white">
        <div class="wrap-full">
            <div class="image-gallery-wrap" data-total-slides="6" data-current-slide="0">
                
                    <div class="image " data-slide-id="0">
                        <div class="inner-image">
                            <img class="gallery-image" width="100%" src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/20240229-NoisePopFestival-GrayArea-009-Actress-AmandaLynn-1-1.jpg" />
                             <div class="caption"> <center>Immersive Art & Music Performances</> </div>                         </div>
                    </div>

                
                    <div class="image next" data-slide-id="1">
                        <div class="inner-image">
                            <img class="gallery-image" width="100%" src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/PXL_20240323_024303021-scaled.jpg" />
                             <div class="caption"> <center>Immersive Art & Music Performances</> </div>                         </div>
                    </div>

                
                    <div class="image next" data-slide-id="2">
                        <div class="inner-image">
                            <img class="gallery-image" width="100%" src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2023/07/522_GrayArea_DifferenceMachines-1-scaled.jpg" />
                             <div class="caption"> <center>Art & Media Exhibitions</> </div>                         </div>
                    </div>

                
                    <div class="image next" data-slide-id="3">
                        <div class="inner-image">
                            <img class="gallery-image" width="100%" src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/ar-workshop-grand-theater.png" />
                             <div class="caption"> <center>Creative Code Workshops</> </div>                         </div>
                    </div>

                
                    <div class="image next" data-slide-id="4">
                        <div class="inner-image">
                            <img class="gallery-image" width="100%" src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/10/processed_2019GA_Discrete_Talk_266.jpg" />
                             <div class="caption"> <center>Conferences & Artist Talks</> </div>                         </div>
                    </div>

                
                    <div class="image next" data-slide-id="5">
                        <div class="inner-image">
                            <img class="gallery-image" width="100%" src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/05/gala-dinner-1.remini-enhanced.jpg" />
                             <div class="caption"> <center>Benefit Events & Seated Dinners</> </div>                         </div>
                    </div>

                                                <div class="control prev"><i class="fas fa-angle-left"></i></div>
                <div class="control next"><i class="fas fa-angle-right"></i></div>
                            </div>
        </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 heading white no-bottom-padding">
         <div class="wrap text-left">
         <h4 class="heading">Gray Area has retrofitted the historic Grand Theater with modern day sound, lighting and visual capabilities. Located in the vibrant Mission District of San Francisco, Gray Area is the perfect environment for your next event.</h4>
         </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 body-text white">
            <div class="wrap column-2">
                                <div class=" no-break"> 
                                            <h5 class="bold">Grand Theater Rental</h5>
                                        <p><img src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/©Barak-Shrama-19-1-scaled.jpg"></p>
<p>Making up the entire ground floor, the Grand Theater Rental is an excellent option for exhibits and large performances. </p>
<ul>
<li>6,000 square feet</li>
<li>800 maximum capacity</li>
<li>450 seated </li>
</ul>
<p></p>
                    </div>
                                    <div class=" no-break"> 
                                            <h5 class="bold">Lobby</h5>
                                        <p><img src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/©Barak-Shrama-12-scaled.jpg"></p>
<p>With large windows facing lively Mission Street, the lobby is an unparalleled space for hosting a spectrum of events. It is ideal for small functions, pop up retail and showcases.</p>
<ul>
<li>800 square feet</li>
<li> 80 capacity</li>
<li>50 seated</li>
</ul>
                    </div>
                                    <div class=" no-break"> 
                                            <h5 class="bold">Half Theater Rental</h5>
                                        <p><img src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/©Barak-Shrama-17-scaled.jpg"></p>
<p>Including the main stage, lobby, and bar, the Half Theater Rental is perfect for performances, small conferences, and special events. </p>
<ul>
<li>4,000 square feet</li>
<li>400 maximum capacity</li>
<li>250 seated </li>
</ul>
<p></p>
                    </div>
                                    <div class=" no-break"> 
                                            <h5 class="bold">Classroom</h5>
                                        <p><img src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/©Barak-Shrama-2-scaled.jpg"></p>
<p>The classroom is equipped with a 85” screen and small soundsystem, making it perfect for smaller meetings and workshops.</p>
<ul>
<li>250 square feet</li>
<li>30 capacity</li>
</ul>
                    </div>
                            </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 white">
            <div class="wrap text-center">
                                    <a class="button color-4 button-large" href="https://airtable.com/appHZcmX68z1AwtEE/pagBWd7oBGvByR5Vq/form">Venue Rental Form</a>
                            </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 body-text white">
            <div class="wrap column-1">
                                <div class=" no-break"> 
                                            <h5 class="bold">Host your next event in the heart of culture, art, and technology</h5>
                                        <p>Looking for a distinctive venue for your next event? Gray Area provides more than just a rental—it’s a cultural experience.</p>
<p>Our theater features permanent interactive art by renowned artist <b>Rafael Lozano-Hemmer</b> and a <a href="https://grayarea.org/visit/gallery/" target="_blank">gallery with rotating exhibitions</a> by local and international artists. Hosting your event here means immersing your guests in the creative ecosystem of the Bay Area.</p>
                    </div>
                            </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 body-text white">
            <div class="wrap column-2">
                                <div class=" no-break"> 
                                        <p><img src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gray_area_121323-140.jpg"></p>
                    </div>
                                    <div class=" no-break"> 
                                        <p><img src="https://grayarea.org/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/gray_area_7_10_24-002.jpg"></p>
                    </div>
                            </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 heading white no-bottom-padding">
         <div class="wrap text-left">
         <h2 class="heading">Immersive Art & Live Music Performances</h2>
         </div>
        </section>
            <section class="p2 image-gallery white">
        <div class="wrap-full">
            <div class="image-gallery-wrap" data-total-slides="1" data-current-slide="0">
                
                    <div class="image " data-slide-id="0">
                        <div class="inner-image">
